<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🎲 Two Truths and a Lie — B2</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #f8f4f0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            padding: 30px 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            padding: 36px 44px;
            border: 1px solid #e8e0d8;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.0rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2c3e50;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .subhead {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #5f6a7a;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eae3dc;
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin: 24px 0 12px 0;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eae3dc;
        }

        .discussion-box {
            background: #f0ece6;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border: 1px solid #e6ddd4;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .discussion-box h4 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .discussion-box ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: #5f6a7a;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .my-statements {
            background: #fcf9f6;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border: 1px solid #e6ddd4;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .my-statements .field {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .my-statements .field label {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .my-statements .field input[type="text"] {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd6ce;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            background: #ffffff;
            transition: border-color 0.15s;
        }

        .my-statements .field input[type="text"]:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #b85a1a;
        }

        .statements-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 12px 0 16px 0;
        }

        .statement-card {
            background: #fcf9f6;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e6ddd4;
            text-align: center;
            transition: background 0.1s;
        }

        .statement-card:hover {
            background: #f8f2ec;
        }

        .statement-card .number {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #b85a1a;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .statement-card .text {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #1e2a3a;
            margin: 4px 0 8px 0;
            min-height: 2.8em;
        }

        .statement-card .guess {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .statement-card .guess label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #5f6a7a;
        }

        .statement-card .guess input[type="radio"] {
            accent-color: #b85a1a;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .tg-footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            padding-top: 14px;
            border-top: 2px solid #e8e0d8;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #5f6a7a;
        }

        .tg-footer a {
            color: #b85a1a;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .tg-footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .btn-pdf {
            background: #b85a1a;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 60px;
            padding: 10px 32px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(184, 90, 26, 0.25);
            transition: background 0.15s;
        }

        .btn-pdf:hover {
            background: #9e4a14;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                padding: 0.1in;
            }
            .container {
                box-shadow: none;
                border: 1px solid #ccc;
                padding: 24px 28px;
            }
            .btn-pdf {
                display: none;
            }
            .statement-card {
                background: #faf8f6;
                border: 1px solid #ccc;
            }
            .my-statements .field input[type="text"] {
                border: 1px solid #999;
                background: #faf8f6;
            }
            .discussion-box {
                background: #f0ece6;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .container {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
            .statements-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .statement-card .text {
                min-height: auto;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Шапка -->
    <h1>🎲 Two Truths and a Lie</h1>
    <div class="subhead">B2 · Grammar &amp; Speaking · Warm-up / Icebreaker</div>

    <!-- ПОЛЕЗНЫЕ ФРАЗЫ -->
    <div class="section-title">🗣️ Useful Phrases for B2</div>

    <div class="discussion-box">
        <h4>🔹 Asking questions to discover the lie:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Could you elaborate on that?</strong> — Расскажите подробнее об этом.</li>
            <li><strong>What makes you say that?</strong> — Почему вы так говорите?</li>
            <li><strong>How come you decided to...?</strong> — Как так получилось, что вы решили...?</li>
            <li><strong>I find that hard to believe.</strong> — Мне в это трудно поверить.</li>
            <li><strong>That doesn't quite add up.</strong> — Это не совсем сходится / логично.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="discussion-box" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <h4>🔹 Expressing doubt or certainty:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>I'm pretty sure that's not true.</strong> — Я почти уверен, что это неправда.</li>
            <li><strong>I have a strong feeling that #2 is the lie.</strong> — У меня сильное ощущение, что #2 — ложь.</li>
            <li><strong>That sounds suspiciously specific.</strong> — Это звучит подозрительно конкретно.</li>
            <li><strong>I'm leaning towards #3 being the lie.</strong> — Я склоняюсь к тому, что #3 — ложь.</li>
            <li><strong>I'm torn between #1 and #2.</strong> — Я колеблюсь между #1 и #2.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="discussion-box" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <h4>🔹 Revealing the truth:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>The lie was #3 — I've actually been to...</strong></li>
            <li><strong>You got it! The lie was #1 because...</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Surprisingly, #2 was the lie!</strong></li>
            <li><strong>I bet you thought #1 was the lie, but it's actually true!</strong></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- ВАШИ УТВЕРЖДЕНИЯ -->
    <div class="section-title">✍️ Your Statements</div>

    <div class="my-statements">
        <p style="color: #5f6a7a; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Write your <strong>three statements</strong> below. Use different tenses and advanced vocabulary.
        </p>

        <div class="field">
            <label>📌 Statement 1 (Truth)</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Write your first truth here..." aria-label="Truth 1">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label>📌 Statement 2 (Truth)</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Write your second truth here..." aria-label="Truth 2">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label>📌 Statement 3 (Lie)</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Write your lie here (make it believable!)..." aria-label="Lie">
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #5f6a7a;">
            💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Use a mix of tenses — Present Perfect, Past Simple, Used to, Present Continuous for future, etc.
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- УГАДЫВАНИЕ -->
    <div class="section-title">🔍 Guess the Lie</div>

    <p style="color: #5f6a7a; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">
        Listen to your partner's statements. Ask questions, then decide which one is the lie.
    </p>

    <div class="statements-grid">
        <div class="statement-card">
            <div class="number">#1</div>
            <div class="text">[Your partner's first statement]</div>
            <div class="guess">
                <label><input type="radio" name="guess" value="1"> Truth</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="guess" value="1-lie"> Lie</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="statement-card">
            <div class="number">#2</div>
            <div class="text">[Your partner's second statement]</div>
            <div class="guess">
                <label><input type="radio" name="guess" value="2"> Truth</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="guess" value="2-lie"> Lie</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="statement-card">
            <div class="number">#3</div>
            <div class="text">[Your partner's third statement]</div>
            <div class="guess">
                <label><input type="radio" name="guess" value="3"> Truth</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="guess" value="3-lie"> Lie</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FOLLOW-UP DISCUSSION -->
    <div class="section-title">💬 Follow-up Discussion</div>

    <div class="discussion-box">
        <h4>After revealing the lie, discuss:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>What made you suspect that statement?</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Did you use any specific strategies to detect the lie?</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Which statement surprised you the most? Why?</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Would you like to share more details about any of your truths?</strong></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Футер -->
    <div class="tg-footer">
        <span style="opacity:0.6;">📱</span>
        <strong>Связь с преподавателем:</strong>
        <a href="#" onclick="return false;">@commander_cotty</a> (Telegram)
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
